{"id":469,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"自主性と創造性を育てる六年一貫の甲陽学院","feature_description":"甲陽学院中学校は中高一貫教育を行い、中高の内容を整理した6年一貫カリキュラムで学びます。習熟度別や進路別のクラス編成をせず、原則として担任団が6年間持ち上がります。生徒による実行委員会が行事を企画・運営し、クラブ活動は入部制限を設けず兼部も可能です。学業成績が不振でも即座に活動を停止せず、学習との両立を状況に応じて判断します。","clubs":[{"id":9274,"name":"野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.koyo.ac.jp/j_seitokai.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9275,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.koyo.ac.jp/j_seitokai.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9276,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.koyo.ac.jp/j_seitokai.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9277,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.koyo.ac.jp/j_seitokai.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9278,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.koyo.ac.jp/j_seitokai.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9279,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.koyo.ac.jp/j_seitokai.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9280,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.koyo.ac.jp/j_seitokai.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9281,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.koyo.ac.jp/j_seitokai.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9282,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.koyo.ac.jp/j_seitokai.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9283,"name":"柔道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.koyo.ac.jp/j_seitokai.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9284,"name":"物理部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.koyo.ac.jp/j_seitokai.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9285,"name":"音楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.koyo.ac.jp/j_seitokai.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9286,"name":"鉄道研究部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.koyo.ac.jp/j_seitokai.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9287,"name":"化学部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.koyo.ac